{"id":"d0a48eeb-970a-4634-9196-45a5b3bc9071","object":"chat.completion","created":1794481696,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;}\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  :root{\n    --bg:#F5F2E9;\n    --surface:#F3F0E7;\n    --ink:#1B2620;\n    --muted:#5C665D;\n    --p1:#4F5E43;\n    --p2:#B4914A;\n    --p3:#8C9FB2;\n    --line:#A3AC9E;\n    --serif:Georgia,\"Songti SC\",\"Times New Roman\",serif;\n    --sans:\"Archivo\",\"Helvetica Neue\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",Arial,sans-serif;\n  }\n  .slide{\n    position:relative;\n    width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;\n    background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);\n    font-family:var(--sans);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- background field ---------- */\n  .bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;background:\n    radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 2% 0%,rgba(180,145,74,.10),transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(880px 760px at 46% 40%,rgba(140,159,178,.10),transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(950px 760px at 96% 96%,rgba(79,94,67,.10),transparent 72%),\n    linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%);}\n  .bg:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(27,38,32,.04) 0 1px,transparent 1px 160px);}\n  .dots{position:absolute;z-index:1;background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(27,38,32,.45) 1.05px,transparent 1.15px);background-size:15px 15px;}\n  .dots-a{left:1300px;top:0;width:420px;height:126px;opacity:.30;}\n  .dots-b{left:96px;top:946px;width:560px;height:100px;opacity:.16;}\n  .gridline{position:absolute;z-index:1;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.06);}\n  .g1{left:480px;}.g2{left:960px;}.g3{left:1440px;}\n  .edge{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:1874px;top:120px;width:40px;height:840px;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(140,159,178,.24),rgba(140,159,178,.05) 68%,rgba(140,159,178,0));}\n  .edge:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1px;height:840px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.14);}\n\n  /* ---------- frame ---------- */\n  .top-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:48px;width:1728px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.34);z-index:6;}\n  .left-rule{position:absolute;left:60px;top:40px;width:1px;height:958px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.24);z-index:6;}\n  .tick{position:absolute;left:54px;width:13px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.42);z-index:7;}\n  .tick1{top:300px;}\n  .tick2{top:612px;}\n  .rail-label{position:absolute;left:44px;top:518px;transform:rotate(-90deg);transform-origin:left top;\n    font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:5px;color:#637067;white-space:nowrap;z-index:8;}\n  .top-meta{position:absolute;left:98px;top:60px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4.2px;color:#4f5b53;z-index:8;}\n  .foot-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;bottom:96px;width:1728px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.16);z-index:6;}\n  .page-no{position:absolute;right:96px;bottom:40px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;color:#657066;z-index:9;}\n  .foot-note{position:absolute;left:96px;bottom:40px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#7b857c;z-index:9;}\n\n  /* ---------- header ---------- */\n  .eyebrow{position:absolute;left:96px;top:126px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:6px;color:var(--p2);z-index:6;}\n  h1{position:absolute;left:96px;top:154px;margin:0;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:66px;line-height:1.16;\n    font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--ink);z-index:6;}\n  .lede{position:absolute;left:98px;top:252px;margin:0;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:var(--muted);z-index:6;}\n\n  .stat-group{position:absolute;right:96px;top:132px;display:flex;z-index:6;}\n  .stat{padding:0 38px;text-align:right;border-left:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.18);}\n  .stat:first-child{border-left:none;padding-left:0;}\n  .stat:last-child{padding-right:0;}\n  .stat .label{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3.6px;color:var(--muted);}\n  .stat .val{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:56px;line-height:1.1","reasoning_content":"Let me create a page 4 HTML matching the visual style: cream bg (#F5F2E9), ink #1B2620, accents #4F5E43, #B4914A, #8C9FB2, line #A3AC9E. Serif display font (Georgia fallback since no external fonts allowed), body sans-serif.\n\nLayout: title top-left area, main content: three touchpoint cards + a 5-week timeline.\n\nContent required:\n- 触点类型3类：门店海报、社区社群、公众号\n- 素材版本14套\n- 第一周：准备素材\n- 第二至四周：发布并收集反馈\n- 第五周：复盘\n- Page number 4 / 6 bottom right.\n\nDesign: \n- Background field with radial gradients, dot field, gridlines, top rule, left rail.\n- Top meta \"溪木咖啡品牌传播 / 触点安排\" — careful, must be factual, fine.\n- Title: 触点安排：三类触点与五周节奏\n- Left column: 3 touchpoint cards (门店海报 / 社区社群 / 公众号), plus a stat block 触点类型 3类 / 素材版本 14套.\n- Right/bottom: timeline of 5 weeks: W1 准备素材; W2-4 发布并收集反馈; W5 复盘.\n\nLet me do a layout: header at top (y~120-260). Then a two-column: left 700px for touchpoints & stats; right for week timeline as horizontal steps? Maybe better: top row of 3 touchpoint cards + stat band, then full-width timeline at bottom with 3 segments.\n\nLayout plan (1920×1080):\n- margin 96.\n- top meta at top 61.\n- Title block: y ~140-300. Title font ~72-80px serif.\n- Subtitle line.\n- Touchpoint cards row: y 350-520, three cards width ~520 each with gaps, plus a stat card (素材版本14套) maybe in a separate right block. Actually could do 4 cards: 3 touchpoints + stat. But stat differs. Let's do: three touchpoint cards (each 400 wide) on left ~1290px, and a stat panel on right 380 wide with \"触点类型 3类\" and \"素材版本 14套\".\n- Timeline: y 620-950 full width with 3 phase segments: 第一周 / 第二至四周 / 第五周, each with axis line and node dots. Represent 5 weeks as 5 tick columns? Better: a 5-cell week track (第1周…第5周) with phases bracketed below. That reads nicely: 5 equal columns, cells labeled 第一周...第五周, with phase grouping bars: 准备素材 (col1), 发布并收集反馈 (cols2-4), 复盘 (col5).\n\nLet's do that: a timeline with 5 columns, top row circles with week numbers, then phase bars underneath grouping.\n\nSimpler and robust: \nRow of 5 week cells (each ~330 wide), each cell has a big number and label, and under the row a set of phase bars aligned to the grid.\n\nGiven fixed widths, using absolute positioning is safest. But I can use flex/grid with precise math. I'll use absolute positioning with computed values.\n\nContent area: left 96, right 1824 (width 1728). Hmm reference uses margin-x 96 and width 1760 (96..1856). Let's use left 96, right edge 1824 → content width 1728. Actually 1920-96-96 = 1728. Good.\n\nTimeline: 5 columns across 1728 → each 336 with gap 12 → 5*336 = 1680 + 4*12=48 = 1728. Nice.\n\nWeek cells: x = 96 + i*(348). 348 = 336+12. So x: 96, 444, 792, 1140, 1488.\n\nPhase bars: \n- Phase 1 (准备素材): spans col1 → x96 w336.\n- Phase 2 (发布并收集反馈): spans col2-col4 → x444 w = 444+3*348-12 = 444+1044-12=1476; width = 1476-444 = 1032. Check: 3*336 + 2*12 = 1008+24=1032. ✓\n- Phase 3 (复盘): x1488 w336.\n\nVertical placement:\n- Title area: 150–300.\n- Touchpoint section: 330–560.\n- Timeline section: 640–980.\n\nFooter page number bottom right: right 96, bottom 48.\n\nLet me write the CSS.\n\nColors: use variables.\n\nElements:\n- .bg-field with radial gradients.\n- .dot-field decor.\n- .register circle top-right (from reference) — decorative ring.\n- .top-rule at 96/48 width 1728.\n- .top-meta text at left 98 top 61: \"溪木咖啡 · 品牌传播\" letterspacing.\n- .page-no maybe top-left? Reference has page-no left 28 top 61. But requirement: page number bottom right \"4 / 6\". I'll put in bottom right.\n\nTypography: serif display for numbers/titles — but no external fonts; use Georgia, 'Songti SC', serif. Chinese serif fallback: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif. Fine.\n\nTitle: font-size 72px, letter-spacing 1px, weight 700? For Chinese serif at 72 looks fine.\n\nLet me draft.\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;}\n:root{\n --bg:#F5F2E9; --surface:#F3F0E7; --ink:#1B2620; --muted:#5C665D;\n --p1:#4F5E43; --p2:#B4914A; --p3:#8C9FB2; --line:#A3AC9E;\n --serif:Georgia,\"Songti SC\",\"Times New Roman\",serif;\n --sans:\"Archivo\",\"Helvetica Neue\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",Arial,sans-serif;\n}\n.slide{position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink);}\n```\n\nBackground layers similar to reference.\n\nThen content.\n\nHeader:\n```\n<div class=\"top-meta\">溪木咖啡品牌传播</div>\n<div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"rail-label\">TOUCHPOINTS · WEEKLY RHYTHM</div>\n```\nHmm English labels — decorative is fine? Style reference uses them. Keep minimal, maybe \"触点安排 / 4\" ... Better avoid fabricated content; English decorative label okay but let's keep Chinese: rail label \"触点安排 · 五周节奏\". Actually a vertical rail label is decorative; use \"TOUCHPOINT PLAN · 5 WEEKS\"? Style ref uses English uppercase labels. I'll use \"TOUCHPOINT PLAN / 5-WEEK RHYTHM\" — it's just a translation, not new fact. Fine.\n\nTitle area:\n```\n<div class=\"title-block\">\n  <div class=\"eyebrow\">04 — 触点安排</div>  -- hmm, page number duplication; maybe eyebrow \"触点安排\"\n  <h1>触点安排：三类触点与五周节奏</h1>\n  <p class=\"lede\">触点类型 3 类 · 素材版本 14 套 · 传播周期 5 周</p>\n</div>\n```\nCareful: 传播周期5周 is from doc — yes.\n\nThen touchpoint cards: 3 cards, each with index number, name, and maybe a small note. Content per card: just the name. To avoid filler, add short factual descriptor? The doc only gives names. I can add \"触点类型 3 类\" as a section label and each card having the name plus small \"触点 01/02/03\". Keep it clean.\n\nCard layout: 3 cards across left area width? Let's do: cards region x 96..1236 (width 1140), three cards each 364 with gap 24: 3*364+2*24=1092+48=1140 ✓. Then stat panel x 1260..1824 (width 564). Hmm 1824-1260=564. Cards: x = 96, 484, 872.\n\nActually maybe better: cards full width 1728 split into 3 of 560 with gaps 24: 3*560+48=1728 ✓. Then stat info as a band. Let's think about hierarchy.\n\nAlternative layout: \n- Left column (width ~600): title + stat panel (触点类型3类 / 素材版本14套).\n- Right: 3 touchpoint cards stacked? \n\nI'll go with:\nRow A (touchpoints): three cards across full 1728 width? Each 560 wide, height 200. That's big but fine. Under it, Row B: timeline.\n\nBut then where do the stats go? Put stats in header line as inline \"指标条\": 触点类型 3 类 | 素材版本 14 套 | 传播周期 5 周 | 试点门店 11 家 (11家 is from doc but not in this page's bullets — allowed? The bullet list doesn't include it; safer to skip or include? It's factual from doc but page focus is touchpoints. I'll include 触点类型3类、素材版本14套、传播周期5周 only.) Actually 传播周期5周 appears in \"五周节奏\" anyway. I'll include 触点类型3类 和 素材版本14套 as two stat cells, plus 传播周期5周.\n\nPlan:\n- Header (y 130–300): title left; right side small stat trio aligned right at top? Might crowd. \n\nLet me define vertical layout:\n1. y 48: top rule.\n2. y 61: top meta.\n3. Title block: top 132. eyebrow 18px muted at top 132. h1 at top 168, font 66px, line-height 1.2 → height ~80. lede at 272, 22px.\n4. Divider hairline at y 330 across 1728? optional.\n5. Section label \"触点类型\" small at y 356.\n6. Three cards: top 386, height 178. Each width 560, x 96/680/1264. (96+560=656, gap 24 → 680; 680+560=1240, +24 → 1264; 1264+560=1824 ✓)\n7. Stats strip: top 592? Then timeline 700–1010. Might be tight. Let's compute: cards end at 386+178=564. Stat strip 596–672 (height 76). Timeline section 700–1000. Footer 1010.\n\nTimeline needs: week cells with number + phase bars. Height: header label 30, week row 90, phase bars 110. ~ 260. 700+260=960. OK.\n\nActually let's compress: cards height 160 (386–546), stat strip 578–650 (h 72, inline: 触点类型3类 / 素材版本14套 as two figures), timeline 690–980.\n\nHmm maybe put stats inside the section as part of cards row: a fourth element? Let's simplify: put \"触点类型 3 类\" as section label with big 3, and \"素材版本 14 套\" as a stat chip in the header right side.\n\nDesign decision:\n- Header right: two stat blocks right-aligned: \"触点类型 3 类\" and \"素材版本 14 套\", placed at x ~1200-1824, y 130-230, with vertical divider. Big serif numbers 56px, labels 14px letterspaced.\n\nThat gives balance. Then cards row full width, then timeline full width. \n\nLayout final:\n- Title left: x96, top 130 (eyebrow), h1 top 160 (font 64), lede top 258.\n- Stats right: a group at right 1824, top 150, three cells? Only two stats: 触点类型3类, 素材版本14套. Place at x 1250..1824: two cells each ~270 with divider. Right aligned.\n\nHmm the register circle decoration is top-right in reference at right -7 top -60 radius 260 — would overlap stats. I'll make the decorative ring smaller/fainter, or place at top-right corner partially off-canvas behind stats. Let's keep a subtle ring at right: -140px top, opacity low, behind. Or omit. I'll include a faint ring at top-right corner (behind, z-index 1), stats at z-index 5 with background? Might clash visually. Better: place the register ring at bottom-right area? Bottom right has page number. Let's put ring at right edge middle-lower, faint.\n\nAlternatively skip ring, use dot-field and edge prism only. I'll include a subtle arc decoration at far right edge.\n\nLet me just do:\n- bg-field gradients\n- dot-field top right small block and bottom left\n- vertical gridlines at x 480, 960, 1440 (opacity .06)\n- top rule, left rail with ticks, rail label vertical\n- edge prism on right (subtle, like reference) — reference has .edge-prism at left 1860 rotated. Keep it subtle at right edge with low opacity.\n\nNow cards design: surface #F3F0E7 with 1px border rgba ink .18, top accent bar of accent color per card (green, gold, blue). Inside: index \"01\" serif 28px muted, name 34px, and small line \"触点类型 3 类之一\"? Redundant. Maybe small descriptor: for 门店海报 — nothing in doc. Keep: index + name + a thin bottom rule. Under name, small text \"触点 01 / 03\"? That's derived, fine.\n\nMaybe add english small label under each: \"POSTER\" / \"COMMUNITY\" / \"WECHAT\" — translations of 门店海报/社区社群/公众号. Acceptable as decorative. Hmm risk of being seen as fabrication? It's just translation. I'll use Chinese only to be safe, plus a small \"触点 01\" marker.\n\nCard content:\n01 门店海报\n02 社区社群\n03 公众号\n\nTimeline:\nSection label left at y ~660: \"五周节奏\".\nWeek header row: 5 cells with \"第一周\" ... \"第五周\"? Doc uses 第一周, 第二至四周, 第五周. Individual weeks 第1周..第5周 are derived but trivially factual (5 weeks cycle). Safer: show three phase segments directly rather than 5 individual week cells. So timeline = 3 segments with proportional widths: 1/5, 3/5, 1/5.\n\nSegment widths: total 1728. Segment1 = 336, seg2 = 1032, seg3 = 336, with gaps 12 (i.e., use inner track). Let's make a track: 3 blocks with 16px gaps: block1 336, block2 1032, block3 336, gaps 2*16=32 → total 1736. Slightly over. Adjust: total 1728, gaps 16 each: avail = 1728-32 = 1696; proportional: 1/5=339.2, 3/5=1017.6, 1/5=339.2. Just use flex with flex:1 / flex:3 / flex:1 → widths 339.2, 1017.6, 339.2. Column and phase blocks align? Not needed; the phase block itself carries the label.\n\nBetter design: a horizontal axis line at y with three blocks above/below:\n- Each block: week-range label small (\"W01\" / \"W02–W04\" / \"W05\"? derived from 第一周/第二至四周/第五周). Use \"第 1 周\", \"第 2–4 周\", \"第 5 周\" — that's a re-encoding of given facts. Fine.\n- Big title: 准备素材 / 发布并收集反馈 / 复盘.\n- Under: bullet-ish short line.\n\nSegment 2 spans three weeks, so inside it, maybe show three small ticks to indicate 3 weeks. Nice touch: within seg2, show three faint dotted subdivisions. Keep simple.\n\nLet's also add \"素材版本 14 套\" note related to 第一周 准备素材: doc says 素材版本14套 and 第一周准备素材. Linking them is inferential; keep separate (stat in header). Good.\n\nNow timeline vertical geometry:\n